1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,395
Do this in the first ten minutes after you wake up.

2
00:00:04,645 --> 00:00:09,062
Your morning sets the tone for your whole day. Here are five simple habits.

3
00:00:09,912 --> 00:00:14,200
One. Drink a glass of water. Your body just went hours without any.

4
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:19,887
Two. Get some daylight. Open the curtains, or step outside for a few minutes.

5
00:00:20,837 --> 00:00:24,519
Three. Don't grab your phone yet. Give your mind a calm start.

6
00:00:25,369 --> 00:00:29,436
Four. Move your body. Even a one-minute stretch helps you wake up.

7
00:00:30,386 --> 00:00:33,018
Five. Pick your top three goals for today.

8
00:00:34,068 --> 00:00:37,656
Quick check. Which one do you already do? Tell me in the comments.

9
00:00:39,306 --> 00:00:43,906
Try all five for one week. Follow me for more health and wellness content.

